  },
  "native_refinement_note": "Guarded native ink corrections clarify existing eyes and facial details. Source art, fit and per-species palettes retained. Orientation corrections keep enemy fronts facing left and player rear portraits facing upper right.",
  "evolution_differentiation_note": "Dozebear is a low, drowsy quadruped with a mostly closed narrow dream slit; Denumbra is an upright broad-shouldered guardian around a vertical open dream den. Guarded native corrections retain Dozebear\u2019s heavy eyelid and separate Denumbra\u2019s true pupil and embedded dream-face eyes. Densy recipe retained."
